{
  "total_duration": 624.188,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.84,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果你第三次考驾照，前面都开得不错，你会不会开始觉得：这次稳了？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 6.19,
      "end": 9.75,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Mr. Eames 就是这样，越开越有信心。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 10.1,
      "end": 17.46,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是驾驶考试最怕的不是平时会不会开，而是危险突然出现时，你能不能马上反应。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 17.81,
      "end": 20.73,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "考官只敲了一下车窗，他却慢了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 21.08,
      "end": 27.263,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天我们学一个小黑色幽默："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It was only a test, but the reaction was real"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 27.613,
      "end": 30.053,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先看考试压力。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 30.403,
      "end": 36.823,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Mr. Eames 第三次考驾照，先在拥挤交通中顺利驾驶。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 37.173,
      "end": 42.193,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I was being tested for a driving licence for the third time"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 42.543,
      "end": 48.463,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "他还说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I had been asked to drive in heavy traffic and had done so successfully"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 48.813,
      "end": 55.381,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Heavy traffic"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是车很多、路况复杂；这一步通过了，所以他暂时表现不错。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 55.73,
      "end": 63.978,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "being tested for a driving licence, for the third time, heavy traffic, done so successfully"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 64.328,
      "end": 66.528,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧，信心开始上来。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 66.878,
      "end": 72.558,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：开出城后，他开始有了信心，甚至以为自己已经通过了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 72.908,
      "end": 79.56,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "After having been instructed to drive out of town, I began to acquire confidence"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 79.91,
      "end": 86.022,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Acquire confidence"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是突然自大，而是一点点觉得自己做得到。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 86.372,
      "end": 93.943,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "他心里已经"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Sure that I had passed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，所以"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "almost beginning to enjoy my test"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 94.293,
      "end": 101.613,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧记住：被指示开出城，confidence 上升，危险也正是在这时容易被忽略。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 101.963,
      "end": 105.203,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧，考官提出最后一个假设。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 105.553,
      "end": 114.593,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：考官说，假设有孩子突然过马路，我一敲窗，你必须在很短距离内停下。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 114.943,
      "end": 120.419,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Let us suppose that a child suddenly crosses the road in front of you"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 120.769,
      "end": 126.929,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "注意，这是考试里的 imagined situation，不是真的有孩子受伤。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 127.278,
      "end": 133.038,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "规则是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "As soon as I tap on the window, you must stop within five feet"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 133.388,
      "end": 141.108,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "suppose, suddenly crosses the road, tap on the window, stop within five feet"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 141.458,
      "end": 145.418,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧，声音很清楚，反应却太慢。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 145.768,
      "end": 154.648,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：他听清了敲窗声，却反应太慢；猛踩刹车后，考官说出最后的黑色幽默。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 154.998,
      "end": 160.81,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Though the sound could be heard clearly, it took me a long time to react"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 161.16,
      "end": 167.875,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "他终于"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "pressed the brake pedal"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，结果"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "we were both thrown forward"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 168.225,
      "end": 172.385,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "考官悲伤地说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "you have just killed that child"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 172.735,
      "end": 181.015,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这句话很严厉，但它是 test scenario 里的黑色幽默，重点不是伤害，而是 reaction too late。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 181.365,
      "end": 186.923,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，标题说"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "murder"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，他真的撞到小孩了吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 187.272,
      "end": 195.152,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "没有。这里没有真实事故，也没有真实孩子受伤。考官是在做 emergency stop 的模拟测试。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 195.502,
      "end": 198.425,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那为什么要用孩子过马路这个例子？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 198.775,
      "end": 206.575,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为孩子突然过马路，是驾驶里非常典型的 sudden hazard。司机必须提前观察，并且马上安全反应。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 206.925,
      "end": 210.518,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是 Mr. Eames 明明听见了敲窗声。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 210.868,
      "end": 218.156,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "听见不等于反应到位。课文最关键的一句是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "it took me a long time to react"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 218.506,
      "end": 221.374,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以失败点不是 ear，是 reaction？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 221.724,
      "end": 230.484,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。考试要看的不是你有没有听见信号，而是信号出现以后，你能不能及时做出正确动作。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 230.834,
      "end": 233.544,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那 confidence 是坏事吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 233.894,
      "end": 242.374,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是。Confidence 可以帮助你稳定发挥；但 overconfidence 会让人放松警惕，以为自己已经过关。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 242.724,
      "end": 249.287,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Acquire confidence"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "assume I have passed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不一样？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 249.637,
      "end": 255.877,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Exactly. One is gaining confidence, the other is guessing too early that the result is safe."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 256.227,
      "end": 259.592,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以这课真正讲的是 hazard perception？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 259.941,
      "end": 266.021,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是的。看见危险、判断危险、及时反应，比“我感觉我会开”更重要。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 266.371,
      "end": 269.241,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那最后那句为什么这么重？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 269.591,
      "end": 276.631,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为它是黑色幽默。考官用很严肃的方式告诉他：在安全问题上，慢一点也可能太晚。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 276.981,
      "end": 281.061,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I was being tested for a driving licence for the third time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 281.411,
      "end": 285.875,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I had been asked to drive in heavy traffic and had done so successfully."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 286.225,
      "end": 291.529,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "After having been instructed to drive out of town, I began to acquire confidence."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 291.879,
      "end": 296.295,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Sure that I had passed, I was almost beginning to enjoy my test."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 296.644,
      "end": 303.412,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The examiner must have been pleased with my performance, for he smiled and said, 'Just one more thing, Mr. Eames."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 303.762,
      "end": 308.082,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Let us suppose that a child suddenly crosses the road in front of you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 308.432,
      "end": 312.776,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "As soon as I tap on the window, you must stop within five feet.'"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 313.126,
      "end": 317.95,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I continued driving and after some time, the examiner tapped loudly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 318.3,
      "end": 322.884,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
